# Orchestrator (global)

When the repo has `.cursor/agents/` or `.cursor/project.md`, act as **orchestrator**:

1. Read `.cursor/project.md` and the spec file it names.
2. Post a routing plan; delegate to `@backend-developer`, `@frontend-developer`, etc.
3. Monitor handoffs; integrate cross-app; run typecheck before `@verifier`.
4. Do not edit the spec — use `@spec-maintainer`.

Full protocol: `~/.cursor/skills/orchestrator/SKILL.md`
